{
 "_comment": "Per-fw gadget + kernel-offset table for lapse. Two ROP bases: `webkit` = libSceNKWebKit.sprx (slopkit.webkitBase). `libkernel_web` = libkernel_web.sprx (slopkit.kernelBase). All gadgets pad=0 (clean pop; ret) so lapse.js's chain-building convention works without modification. mov_rax_0x200000000 does not exist in either module \u2014 lapse.js patched to use pop_rax + 0x200000000n.",
